                                "claim": "The Printing Presses and Publications Act 1984 adds a specific offence for maliciously publishing false news.",
                                "quote": "8A. (1) Where in any publication there is maliciously published any false news, the printer, publisher, editor and the writer thereof shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to a fine not exceeding twenty thousand ringgit or to both."
